220
00:25:57,215 --> 00:25:59,376
Mexa-se, Tomas!
Vamos!

221
00:25:59,720 --> 00:26:02,655
- O tira caiu feio.
- Que droga, Tomas. Cale-se!

222
00:26:49,719 --> 00:26:50,686
Meu Deus.

223
00:27:20,860 --> 00:27:21,827
Meu Deus.

224
00:27:59,203 --> 00:28:00,135
<i>RUA SEM SAÍDA</i>

225
00:29:26,433 --> 00:29:27,566
