356
00:40:36,012 --> 00:40:37,279
Droga.

357
00:41:37,907 --> 00:41:39,374
Della!

358
00:41:50,390 --> 00:41:51,982
Della!

359
00:42:29,811 --> 00:42:31,381
Della!

360
00:43:03,700 --> 00:43:05,200
Della!

361
00:43:53,543 --> 00:43:55,043
Della!

362
